<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>智信科目一、科目二区域·真实地形与概念低模</name><Style id="boundary"><LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>4</width></LineStyle><PolyStyle><color>2600ffff</color></PolyStyle></Style><Style id="point"><IconStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><scale>0.6</scale></IconStyle></Style><LookAt><longitude>113.709023</longitude><latitude>33.864222</latitude><tilt>45</tilt><range>1700</range><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode></LookAt><Folder><name>竞赛边界</name><Placemark><name>WGS84 竞赛边界</name><description><![CDATA[<p>用户提供的 25 个 GNSS/WGS84 点，水平面积约 51.23 公顷。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#boundary</styleUrl><Polygon><tessellate>1</tessellate><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>113.70741944,33.86434444,0 113.70589722,33.86421944,0 113.70581944,33.86480556,0 113.70532222,33.86476944,0 113.70540000,33.86416667,0 113.70383333,33.86402500,0 113.70373889,33.86281389,0 113.70356667,33.86095000,0 113.70715000,33.86063056,0 113.70729167,33.86243611,0 113.70743333,33.86241389,0 113.70861111,33.86235556,0 113.70856944,33.86194167,0 113.70981111,33.86190556,0 113.70973333,33.86041944,0 113.71243611,33.86027500,0 113.71254722,33.86180278,0 113.71280833,33.86550000,0 113.71296944,33.86764722,0 113.71015833,33.86756389,0 113.71019722,33.86801667,0 113.71010556,33.86950556,0 113.70786944,33.86926111,0 113.70770556,33.86573056,0 113.70757500,33.86436667,0 113.70741944,33.86434444,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>真实地形与低模（相对地面）</name><description><![CDATA[<p><b>真实数据：</b>地形面根据 SRTM 公开高程样本插值，原始采样间距约 70 米，垂直基准 EGM96。</p><p><b>概念模型：</b>三个棕色体块和绿色树冠带是影像判读后的示意体量，位置用于表达场地结构，宽度、长度和高度均非测量值，不可当作设备坐标或飞行障碍物数据。</p>]]></description><Placemark><name>插值地形 + 概念体量（非实测高度）</name><Model><altitudeMode>relativeToGround</altitudeMode><Location><longitude>113.70815878</longitude><latitude>33.86407467</latitude><altitude>0</altitude></Location><Link><href>models/subject12_area_lowpoly.dae</href></Link></Model></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>影像判读点（非实测设备）</name><Placemark><name>A · 东侧农田与田间通道</name><description><![CDATA[<p>成片条带状种植纹理，田界及通道清晰，代表点位于 P19—P16 西侧。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>作物种类、株高、田埂落差、地表承载条件未知；细小电线不能凭此影像排除。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.71137843,33.86420168,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>B · 中部密集树木带</name><description><![CDATA[<p>可见连续树冠及规则栽植纹理，呈南北向长条分布。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>树种、树高和当前范围未知；不能把该带视为无障碍空地。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70889013,33.86377122,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>C · 北侧浅色场地与矩形构筑物</name><description><![CDATA[<p>P22—P23 南侧为大块浅色地表，中部可见矩形设施及其投影。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>用途无法确认；是否存在围栏、桩柱、活动设备及其高度需现场查证。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70899381,33.86863525,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D · 北部规则分格地块</name><description><![CDATA[<p>主通道东侧可见规则小方格、条形设施和少量蓝色屋面。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>可能为种植或试验性地块，具体用途未确认；不作比赛设备命名。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70899381,33.86631088,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>E · 北部深色矩形池状地物</name><description><![CDATA[<p>规则矩形深色面，边缘较直，邻近条状设施；影像上疑似池塘或水池。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>水深、池壁高度、是否蓄水及用途均未知；需确认是否为真实水面。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70873461,33.86719760,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>F · 西南侧建筑与硬化通道</name><description><![CDATA[<p>P6—P10 内侧可见小型屋面、成片绿化及规则或弯曲通道。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>建筑用途、屋面高度、围栏和开放状态未知；不能据影像判定起降条件。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70598711,33.86291030,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G · 西南侧池塘与混合地表</name><description><![CDATA[<p>P8 东北侧可见深色不规则池状地物，周围为裸地、低矮植被及小路。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>水位、岸线软硬、排水能力及季节变化未知。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70396537,33.86144672,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>H · 西北侧椭圆跑道状场地（区域外）</name><description><![CDATA[<p>P23 西南方向的边界外可见椭圆环形道及内部场地。</p><p><b>待核实：</b>仅作周边参照，不纳入本次竞赛边界；不能由外形确认机构或场地名称。</p>]]></description><styleUrl>#point</styleUrl><Point><altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode><coordinates>113.70619447,33.86839421,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder><Folder><name>历史卫星影像</name><GroundOverlay><name>Esri World Imagery · 2017-07-24</name><Icon><href>files/satellite.jpg</href></Icon><LatLonBox><north>33.871713</north><south>33.857767</south><east>113.718354</east><west>113.699646</west></LatLonBox></GroundOverlay></Folder></Document></kml>